# Reviewed findings from tools/cran-scan.R that are not defects.
# Format: <ID> <where-glob>  # <reason>   (the reason is required)
# `just cran-scan` fails on any finding not listed here and on entries that
# no longer match anything, so keep this list short and current.

CODE-SYSTEM R/export.R:*  # save_svg_ssr() finds node with Sys.which() and aborts with install instructions; Node.js is in SystemRequirements
THIRD-PARTY inst/htmlwidgets/lib/draw  # the package's own renderer code, not bundled third-party code
NAME Package  # 0.5.4 is an update of the package published on CRAN as 0.5.3
CODE-HOME tests/testthat/test-mermaid.R:*  # "~" is a glyph in the measured character set, not a path
DESC-QUOTES Description  # CRAN (0.5.3 review) quotes only package, software, and API names; JSON and R Markdown are formats
DESC-ACRONYMS Description  # JSON names a standard data format, unquoted as CRAN requested in the 0.5.3 review
